    "title_en": "O-<i>N</i>structures on vertex operator algebras",
    "abstract_en": "We study Nijenhuis operators on vertex operator algebras and their connection to O-operators; this connection leads to a further exploration of O-N structures and O-dual-N structures. We prove that both an O-N structure and an O-dual-N structure can generate a series of O-operators. Conversely, under certain conditions, a pair of O-operators can also induce an O-dual-N structure.",
